{"quest_id": 6917, "name": "おもちゃの行進", "description": "集団となって迫るミニメカドラゴンを\n退け、元凶の待つおもちゃ工場へ急げ！\n<特定のタイミングで吹雪が発生する>\n中級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃8体）", "modifier_notes": ["特定のタイミングで吹雪が発生する"], "event": "デーモンサンタのおもちゃ工場", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920136, "map_no": 3380, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 40, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 10, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_range": 120, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 224, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2120704, "race_id": 2, "special_effect_id": 449, "change_to": 1, "missile_id": 414, "missile": {"speed": 10.0, "splash": 80}, "master_id": 32091, "global_id": 5710, "ranged": true, "to_global_id": 5713, "spawn_sec": 1}, {"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 1, "form_count": 2, "tags": ["機械"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 224, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 0.800000011920929, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2120768, "race_id": 2, "special_effect_id": 449, "missile_id": 414, "missile": {"speed": 10.0, "splash": 80}, "master_id": 32094, "global_id": 5713}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 13, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 50, "attack_wait": 30, "attack_interval": 165, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099664, "master_id": 185, "global_id": 184, "spawn_sec": 5}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1200, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 20, "attack_range": 120, "attack_speed": 30, "attack_wait": 50, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2099648, "missile_id": 8, "missile": {"speed": 6.0}, "master_id": 184, "global_id": 183, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 42}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 5000, "attack": 380, "base_hp": 5000, "base_attack": 380, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "magic_defense": 10, "attack_speed": 20, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 81, "move_speed": 500.0, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 100, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2120800, "race_id": 16, "change_to": 5, "change_condition": 2, "master_id": 32097, "global_id": 5716, "spawn_sec": 127}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ソラノ", "text": "――はぁ、はぁ……。\nた、助かったわ……。", "face": "u134"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "デューオさん、ソラノさん、\nいったい雪の国に何が起きているのですか？", "face": "l7ee323f1a214"}, {"name": "デューオ", "text": "魔王軍の残党が……雪の国の工場を乗っ取ったんだ。\nミニメカドラゴンのおもちゃは、\nあいつらが作った兵器のひとつだよ。", "face": "u594"}, {"name": "デューオ", "text": "おもちゃ工場から逃げ出す時に、\nエーテルがかばってくれて、\nだからアタシ達は助かったんだけど……。", "face": "u594"}, {"name": "エーテル", "text": "……はぁ……はぁ……っ。\nあ、あたまが……あぁ……ッ！", "face": "u933"}, {"name": "カミラ", "text": "それでエーテルが\n精神支配を受けてしまったんですね……。", "face": "u724"}, {"name": "コーネリア", "text": "話し込んでいる暇はないぞ。\nミニメカドラゴンの軍団が迫っている。", "face": "u1725"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そうですね……。\n王子、ここを切り抜け、この事件の元凶を叩きましょう。\n戦闘の準備をお願いします！", "face": "l15e6155f1c9e"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "デーモン", "text": "――もうよい。下がれエーテル。", "face": "l0e3428ed39e2"}, {"name": "エーテル", "text": "……はい、デーモンさま。", "face": "u933"}, {"name": "デーモン", "text": "ぐぬぬぬ……。\n魔王様を失った我らに、\n更に追い打ちをかけてくるとは卑怯な王子どもめ。", "face": "l0e3428ed39e2"}, {"name": "デーモン", "text": "こうなれば、ゴブリン博士に\n命じてデラックス版を出撃させるしかあるまいな！", "face": "l0e3428ed39e2"}, {"name": "コーネリア", "text": "待てデーモン！！\nエーテルを解放しろ！！", "face": "u1725"}, {"name": "サラサ", "text": "デーモンが向かった先は……。\nやはり、おもちゃ工場が本拠地になっているようね。", "face": "u317"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "エーテルを操るなんて許せませんわ。\n王子、急いで追いかけますわよ！", "face": "u556"}]}], "active": true}